# CodeCity needs no environment variables to build or run.
# GitHub sign-in uses the device flow and stores its token in the OS keychain,
# and projects are kept in a local SQLite database.
#
# Optional switches for development:

# Print per-phase timings from the network analysis (any value turns it on).
# CODECITY_TIMING=1

# Make the MCP server re-analyze every time instead of reusing its snapshot cache.
# CODECITY_MCP_NO_CACHE=1
